 null, "locked": false, "text": "Pipa SATU giliran: kind 'send' | 'resume'\n  (beda hanya di ujung: resume tak punya\n  pesan user baru, snapshot dokumen, POST)\nstream SSE → bangun pesan asisten, event\njalankan client tool (read_active_document,\n  apply_word_edits) → POST tool-result\nsimpan pesan (cloud / lokal) · Stop · pemulihan", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Pipa SATU giliran: kind 'send' | 'resume'\n  (beda hanya di ujung: resume tak punya\n  pesan user baru, snapshot dokumen, POST)\nstream SSE → bangun pesan asisten, event\njalankan client tool (read_active_document,\n  apply_word_edits) → POST tool-result\nsimpan pesan (cloud / lokal) · Stop · pemulihan", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "b7b5f4b03b684a8ab9c2", "type": "rectangle", "x": 695, "y": 570, "width": 640, "height": 173.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["3b3c4fbf1ac34b24b79a"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1218028579, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1923398688, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419178036, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "412ff127e4bd44b8a4fe", "type": "text", "x": 709, "y": 592.1, "width": 386.3, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["3b3c4fbf1ac34b24b79a"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1217571639, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 221819378, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178036, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "useWordDoc  (±3k baris — jantung Office.js)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "useWordDoc  (±