mpilkan login) · tak terjangkau)\napi/mikeApi.ts: endpoint (word-chat, workflows, library,\n  models, playbooks, quick-actions…)\napi/stream.ts: streamAssistant (POST) · resumeAssistant (GET)\nauth/session.ts: signIn · signInWithGoogle · signOut", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "api/client.ts: fetch same-origin /api, cookie HttpOnly,\n  401 → refresh sesi (sessionRefresh: 3 hasil —\n  pulih · kedaluwarsa (tampilkan login) · tak terjangkau)\napi/mikeApi.ts: endpoint (word-chat, workflows, library,\n  models, playbooks, quick-actions…)\napi/stream.ts: streamAssistant (POST) · resumeAssistant (GET)\nauth/session.ts: signIn · signInWithGoogle · signOut", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "6ceb8a916e2b42518413", "type": "rectangle", "x": 880, "y": 810, "width": 900, "height": 189.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "backgroundColor": "#96f2d7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["12237d32b63f4bb29bb2"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1518918816, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1883165334, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419178036, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "599769e79e9f4eb7ad24", "type": "text", "x": 894, "y": 824, "width": 191.4, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["12237d32b63f4bb29bb2"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1740791817, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 937085898, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178036, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Tempat data disimpan", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Tempat data disimpan", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "acdf3c1c55ec44a2a77c", "type": "text", "x": 894, "y": 855.8, "width": 381.6, "height": 130.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["12237d32b63f4bb29bb2"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1172563348, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 947975276, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178036, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "OfficeRuntime.storage: preferensi per pemilik\n  (mode penyimpanan; gagal baca → LOKAL, fail-closed)\nIndexedDB (localWordChats): word-chats, word-chat-messages,\n  word-document-edits — hanya chat 'perangkat ini saja'\nOffice document settings (di dalam .docx): UUID identitas +\n  URL dokumen · registri anchor edit · daftar ID edit yang\n  sudah diterapkan (maks 500)\nCloud: tabel word_* di Postgres (lihat Word D)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "OfficeRuntime.storage: preferensi per pemilik\n  (mode penyimpanan; gagal baca → LOKAL, fail-closed)\nIndexedDB (localWordChats): word-chats, word-chat-messages,\n  word-document-edits — hanya chat 'perangkat ini saja'\nOffice document settings (di dalam .docx): UUID identitas +\n  URL dokumen · registri anchor edit · daftar ID edit yang\n  sudah diterapkan (maks 500)\nCloud: tabel word_* di Postgres (lihat Word D)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "4272bd076b3f4cefbd45", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1820, "y": 810, "width": 620, "height": 189.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["494c33f3dee94b0793bb"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1460843078, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 217031858, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419178036, "li